NOTICE
======

This repository contains the HostMot2 driver for Mesa Electronics FPGA
motion-control cards. The code was extracted from the LinuxCNC project
and retains its full original commit history.

Origin
------

  Upstream project : LinuxCNC
  Upstream repo    : https://github.com/LinuxCNC/linuxcnc
  Source path      : src/hal/drivers/mesa-hostmot2
  Split from commit: 64efb28cd77a16b45ade81e576c784cdc574f40e
  Commit date      : 2026-09-08
  Commit subject   : Merge pull request #4506 from grandixximo/gmoccapy-early-sigterm
  Extraction date  : 2026-09-09
  Extraction method: git subtree split --prefix=src/hal/drivers/mesa-hostmot2

The extracted tree is byte-for-byte identical to the upstream
src/hal/drivers/mesa-hostmot2 directory at the commit named above
(tree ebba780ae0204d8fa68a9e5f81d52f5a5b651d58). It lives under
third_party/linuxcnc/, moved there in one commit that changed no file's
contents, so that everything this repository adds is visibly outside it.
A `git diff` against a fresh subtree split of the same upstream commit,
with that prefix, is empty.

Taking a fix from upstream is: re-run the subtree split at the new
upstream commit, then merge it into third_party/linuxcnc/ and move the
pin recorded above.

